1 1 4 Aug 15 14:42:49 2025                     
SSD.DN.1 {@ Strained S/D {mask ID: 123} open ratio should be >= 6% and be as uniform as possible over chip DRC methodology: Minimum {{{{{PP AND NW} NOT {{{{{{{RH_OD OR RH_PO} OR VAR} OR SR_ESD} OR OD2} OR BJTDMY} OR DIODMY} OR {{NP AND NW} NOT SRM}}} OR {DOD AND PP}} AND {{OD OR DOD} OR SR_DOD}} NOT {{PO OR DPO} OR SR_DPO}} density across full chip >= 6%
  SSD = ((((PPi AND NWi) NOT (((((((RHOD OR RHPO) OR VARi) OR SRESD) OR OD2i) OR BJTDMY) OR DIODMY) OR ((NPi AND NWi) NOT SRM))) OR (DOD AND PPi)) AND ((ODi OR DOD) OR SRDOD)) NOT ((POi OR DPO) OR SRDPO)
  DENSITY SSD < SSD_DN_1 INSIDE OF LAYER CHIPx PRINT SSD.DN.1.density RDB SSD.DN.1.RDB.density
}
